Zandatsu (Android, Phase 5B): default swordman_present_timing = 0 to prevent cutscene slow-motion/lag
on LTPO/VRR and Adreno/HyperOS devices (issues #78, #84, #99, #114) where holding 30 fps frames 20 ms
ahead via VK_GOOGLE_display_timing stalls vkAcquireNextImageKHR. AChoreographer pacing (0042) remains active.

